adguard-debian (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package AdGuard CLI for Debian-based systems.
  * Add systemd integration with a dedicated adguard service account.
  * Store persistent service data under /var/lib/adguard-cli.
  * Support migration from legacy installation data paths.

